    "title": "GoIM 消息发送与投递时序",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "subtitle": "发送方 → Lua 原子写入 → Redis Stream → relay 中继 → Kafka → 持久化消费者 → MySQL",
    "quality_profile": "showcase",
    "viewBox": [1080, 594],
    "column_fit": "spread",
    "animation": "trace",
    "views": [
      {
        "id": "send-and-atomic",
        "label": "发送与原子写入",
        "focus": ["sender", "gateway", "redis"],
        "note": "上行消息经单次 Lua 原子完成校验、ID 分配、收发箱、会话与未读写入，并 XADD 进持久化 Stream。"
      },
      {
        "id": "relay-and-ack",
        "label": "中继与确认",
        "focus": ["gateway", "redis", "kafka", "sender"],
        "note": "relay 从 Stream 读取事件并发布到 Kafka，拿到 ISR 确认后才向发送方回 serverAck。"
      },
      {
        "id": "deliver",
        "label": "实时投递",
        "focus": ["gateway", "sender", "receiver"],
        "note": "Kafka 确认后向在线接收方推送消息；离线用户由上线后的同步补齐。"
      },
      {
        "id": "async-persist",
        "label": "异步持久化",
        "focus": ["consumer", "kafka", "mysql"],
        "note": "消费者幂等落库到 MySQL；失败转 retry Topic，重试 5 次后进入 DLQ。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "participants": [
